              "value": "Your task is to generate a Priority Action item using the static data provided below.\n?? Content\nDisplay the following information:\nStatus: Critical\nCategory: Overview\nTitle: Run replenishment plan\nDescription:\nRun the Simulation Plan to implement the changes\nAction Label: Run Plan Now\nAction\nWhen the action is triggered, execute:\nora.Invoke(RunPlan, {\n  \"command\": \"RunPlan\"\n})"
