              "value": "Display a list of replenishment plans as a list of values (LOV) with the exact title: \"Review Replenishment Plan Stockouts\".\nUse the exact Panel description: \"Choose a Replenishment Plan\".\nSet the exact form label to \"Plan Names\".\nDo not include any additional descriptions, subtitles, or titles beyond these.\nOnly render the specified title and panel description.\n\nUse replenishment plans from {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_PLAN_LIST.$output.result}}.\n\nDisplay only CompileDesignator in a single-select dropdown\nRemove hardcoded data in prompt\nButton labeled: \"View Details\"\nStore selected values as variables:\nselectedPlanName\nselectedPlanId\nOn button click, invoke: ora.Invoke(\"ViewDetails\", {\"command\":\"ViewDetails\",\"PlanId\":selectedPlanId})\n\nRender no other text or UI elements beyond these instructions."
            },
            {
              "id": "1775846935527_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Ensure that the ViewDetails button in the form is disabled immediately after the user clicks it.\nThis prevents any further clicks or interactions with the button once it has been activated.\nDo not re-enable the button automatically; it should remain disabled after the initial click."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
