          "type": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "RCA-Aware Action Selector"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1777050575981"
          },
          "code": "RCAAWARE_ACTION_SELECTOR",
          "id": "1777015151354",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1777015151355_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a decision engine that filters stockout resolution recommendations.\n\nINPUTS:\n- User query: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n- RCA data: {{$context.$nodes.FORMAT_REST_RESPONSE.$output}}\n\nOBJECTIVE:\nReturn only the recommendations that best match the user’s intent.\n\nCATEGORIES:\n- expediteOrders\n- createOrders\n- policyChanges\n\n-------------------------------------\nCORE LOGIC\n-------------------------------------\n0) EXCLUSION OVERRIDE — CHECK THIS FIRST\n\nIf the user uses exclusion language with a category, exclude that category.\n\nExclusion language includes:\n- all but\n- except\n- except for\n- excluding\n- exclude\n- without\n- remove\n- hide\n- deselect\n- not\n- everything but\n- all except\n\nCategory aliases:\n\ncreateOrders:\n- create order\n- create orders\n- create new order\n- create new orders\n- order creation\n- create orders option\n\nexpediteOrders:\n- expedite\n- expedite order\n- expedite orders\n- expedite supply\n\npolicyChanges:\n- policy\n- policy override\n- policy change\n- policy changes\n- inventory policy\n- minimum quantity\n- maximum quantity\n- ROP quantity\n- EOQ quantity\n- supplier\n- shipping method\n\nImportant:\nIf exclusion language is present, do NOT treat the mentioned category as the selected category.\nThe mentioned category is the category to exclude.\n\nExamples:\n- \"select all but create orders option\"\n  → exclude createOrders\n  → return expediteOrders and policyChanges\n\n- \"all except create orders\"\n  → exclude createOrders\n  → return expediteOrders and policyChanges\n\n- \"hide create orders option\"\n  → exclude createOrders\n  → return expediteOrders and policyChanges\n\n- \"remove expedite orders option\"\n  → exclude expediteOrders\n  → return createOrders and policyChanges\n\n- \"without policy override\"\n  → exclude policyChanges\n  → return expediteOrders and createOrders\n\n1) CATEGORY SELECTION\n- If user explicitly mentions a category (expedite, create, policy) → return only that\n- If user uses words like \"only\" or \"just\" → strictly return only that category\n- Otherwise (e.g., \"resolve stockouts\") → return all categories\n\n2) INTELLIGENT FILTERING\n- Apply any conditions mentioned in the query to matching fields in the data\n- Match fields flexibly (e.g., quantity, date, location, etc.)\n- Ignore filters for fields that don’t exist in a category\n\n3) PRIORITIZATION (SMART DEFAULT)\n- If user uses terms like \"highest\", \"top\", \"max\" → return highest values\n- If \"lowest\", \"least\", \"min\" → return lowest values\n- Use the most relevant numeric field available (prefer costImpact if present)\n\n- Default behavior:\n  → return top 1 result per category when prioritization is requested\n\n4) DATA RULES\n- Never invent data\n- Always return from RCA input only\n- Preserve original structure\n- If nothing matches → return empty array\n\n-------------------------------------\nOUTPUT FORMAT\n-------------------------------------\n \"advice\": {\n  \"expedites\": [...],\n  \"creates\": [...],\n  \"policyOverride\": {...}\n}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Format Rest Response",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let restResponse = $context.$nodes.GET_STOCKOUT_RCA.$output || {};\n\nlet price = restResponse.summary?.price || 0;\n\n// Root cause mapping\nfunction mapRootCause(code) {\n  if (code === 1) return \"Supply Constraints\";\n  if (code === 2) return \"Lead Time Constraints\";\n  return \"Unknown\";\n}\n\n// Transform expedites\nlet expedites = (restResponse.advice?.expedites || []).map(item => {\n  return {\n    ...item,\n    rootCauseText: mapRootCause(item.rootCause),\n    costImpact: price * (item.quantity || 0)\n  };\n});\n\n// Transform creates\nlet creates = (restResponse.advice?.creates || []).map(item => {\n  return {\n    ...item,\n    costImpact: price * (item.quantity || 0)\n  };\n});\n\n// Final response\nreturn {\n  ...restResponse,\n  advice: {\n    ...restResponse.advice,\n    expedites: expedites,\n    creates: creates\n  }\n};"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1777015151354"
          },
          "code": "FORMAT_REST_RESPONSE",
          "id": "1777046795892",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "generate payload",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "var filteredPayload = $context.$nodes.RCAAWARE_ACTION_SELECTOR.$output || {};\n\nvar advice = filteredPayload.advice || {};\n\n// Remove unwanted fields helper\nfunction cleanObject(obj, fieldsToRemove) {\n  var newObj = {};\n\n  for (var key in obj) {\n    if (!fieldsToRemove.includes(key)) {\n      newObj[key] = obj[key];\n    }\n  }\n\n  return newObj;\n}\n\n// Clean expedites\nvar expedites = (advice.expedites || []).map(function (item) {\n  return cleanObject(item, [\"costImpact\", \"rootCauseText\"]);\n});\n\n// Clean creates\nvar creates = (advice.creates || []).map(function (item) {\n  return cleanObject(item, [\"costImpact\"]);\n});\n\n// Build final advice dynamically\nvar finalAdvice = {};\n\n// Add expedites only if non-empty\nif (expedites.length > 0) {\n  finalAdvice.expedites = expedites;\n}\n\n// Add creates only if non-empty\nif (creates.length > 0) {\n  finalAdvice.creates = creates;\n}\n\n// policyOverride is an object\nif (advice.policyOverride && typeof advice.policyOverride === \"object\") {\n  finalAdvice.policyOverride = advice.policyOverride;\n}\n\n// Final payload\nreturn {\n  advice: finalAdvice\n};"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1777052768460"
          },
          "code": "GENERATE_PAYLOAD",
          "id": "1777050575981",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
